    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p22_b13",
      "text": "In this section, we present several case studies from our human evaluation (Section 6.2) to qualitatively demonstrate how our\nLBR method mitigates language bias compared to the baseline VIT-trained model. The following examples are illustrated in\nFigure 11.\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.44,
        444.02,
