      "font_size": 9.86,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 257,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p22_b14",
      "text": "\u2022 Case 1 (Complex Scene): The baseline model\u2019s description of the first image contains multiple hallucinations. It\nincorrectly claims a man and a baby are holding cell phones (two Action hallucinations), states there are two laptops\nand one book on the table (two Number hallucinations), and describes a non-existent chair in the background (one\nExistence hallucination). In contrast, the description from our LBR-trained model contains no hallucinations.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        492.73,
        541.44,
        538.72
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        1970,
